        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A long-form RPG years in the making invites you on a time-bending fantasy journey —— It tells the story of a boy named Grance, who is rushed to the hospital after an accident. But when he wakes, he finds himself in a world called &quot;the Tower&quot;... To return to his original world, players will step into Grance’s shoes, embark on an unforeseen journey, and gradually unravel the secrets of this realm. **Exploration: Unlock the world’s truths amid the mist** A high-difficulty exploration system: Each floor of the Tower is a distinct ecological realm — from lava hells to floating isles, mechanical metropolises to forgotten temples — all hiding mysterious gear and hidden bosses. A network of hidden side quests: Over dozens of deeply buried side missions, told through fragmented storytelling, weave together the joys and sorrows of the Tower’s inhabitants. Complete them to unlock unique classes and challenge high-difficulty bosses. **Combat: Hone your edge through a thousand battles** Hundreds of distinct enemies: From mutated fiends lingering in the lower floors to ancient guardians defending the Tower’s peak, each foe boasts unique attack patterns and weakness mechanics. Only strategic combinations can turn the tide. Endless possibilities in skills and classes: 32 character classes form a vast skill system. Each class pairs with unique skill chains, allowing for countless combat styles to be forged. **Progression: Forge your own legendary adventure** A collector’s frenzy with thousands of gear pieces: From humble iron swords and leather armors to the &quot;Stellar Set&quot; — infused with the Tower’s divine power — every piece comes with random affixes and upgrade potential. Exclusive artifacts drop from hidden bosses; &quot;ascended gear&quot; rewarded by side quests unlocks unique effects. A multi-dimensional progression system: Beyond traditional level and stat boosts, the &quot;Multi-Class System&quot; lets your character learn and combine skills from various classes. The Proficiency System permanently boosts all stats. Your progression strategy might even shape the story’s ending. In this years-spanning epic adventure, are you ready to grip your weapon tight and carve Grance’s path home through the Tower’s endless floors?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A long-form RPG years in the making invites you on a time-bending fantasy journey —— It tells the story of a boy named Grance, who is rushed to the hospital after an accident. But when he wakes, he finds himself in a world called &quot;the Tower&quot;... To return to his original world, players will step into Grance’s shoes, embark on an unforeseen journey, and gradually unravel the secrets of this realm. **Exploration: Unlock the world’s truths amid the mist** A high-difficulty exploration system: Each floor of the Tower is a distinct ecological realm — from lava hells to floating isles, mechanical metropolises to forgotten temples — all hiding mysterious gear and hidden bosses. A network of hidden side quests: Over dozens of deeply buried side missions, told through fragmented storytelling, weave together the joys and sorrows of the Tower’s inhabitants. Complete them to unlock unique classes and challenge high-difficulty bosses. **Combat: Hone your edge through a thousand battles** Hundreds of distinct enemies: From mutated fiends lingering in the lower floors to ancient guardians defending the Tower’s peak, each foe boasts unique attack patterns and weakness mechanics. Only strategic combinations can turn the tide. Endless possibilities in skills and classes: 32 character classes form a vast skill system. Each class pairs with unique skill chains, allowing for countless combat styles to be forged. **Progression: Forge your own legendary adventure** A collector’s frenzy with thousands of gear pieces: From humble iron swords and leather armors to the &quot;Stellar Set&quot; — infused with the Tower’s divine power — every piece comes with random affixes and upgrade potential. Exclusive artifacts drop from hidden bosses; &quot;ascended gear&quot; rewarded by side quests unlocks unique effects. A multi-dimensional progression system: Beyond traditional level and stat boosts, the &quot;Multi-Class System&quot; lets your character learn and combine skills from various classes. The Proficiency System permanently boosts all stats. Your progression strategy might even shape the story’s ending. In this years-spanning epic adventure, are you ready to grip your weapon tight and carve Grance’s path home through the Tower’s endless floors?</p>",
        "short_description": "讲述一位名叫格兰斯的少年因为一场意外被送往了医院可是当他醒来的时候却发现自己，已经来到了一个名叫“塔”的世界.....为了能回到原本的世界玩家将扮演格兰斯邂逅一场未知的旅途逐渐解开关于这个世界的秘密",
